            "review_title": "Review at Paris Apéro",
            "review_text": "Bryan H\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam62 contributions\n0\nUne experience merveilleuse!\nDec 2025 • Couples\nNewly opened; we were curious to sample the cuisine of a French restaurant closer to our home and not located in District 1. We were definitely impressed by the quality of food and overall dining experience. What the waitstaff might currently lack in fine dining experience, was certainly made up by their enthusiasm and attention to our needs. The owner, Jacque, also introduced himself and added to the welcomeness of the experience. We start the evening with beef carpaccio, with my wife them ordering the sea bass, while I took the opportunity to try the beef bourguignon. Both stellar dishes! There were a nice variety of options on the wine list, as well. We will definitely be back soon!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 23, 2025",
